{
    "title": "SOYO-Live\u00a0Chat\u00a0&Make\u00a0Friends",
    "description": "The Internet is full of cool people, SOYO lets you meet them.\r\n\r\nSOYO, the incredible social app, not only lets you make friends in random chat and messages but also allows you to start a live chat, use the live chats and live voice to intereact with strangers from all around the world. With SOYO, you can easily meet strangers and discover beautiful surprises at any time. Dive into the world of online chat and enjoy the thrill of real-time voice chat. Plus, you can use various funny emojis to break the ice. SOYO is your ultimate destination for all social things, making it the perfect social app for connecting and building friendships. Join the  SOYO community today and experience the excitement of making new friends through the power of technology.\r\nHope you enjoy the games in SOYO and harvest all the things that you want!\r\n\r\nMain features:\r\n\u2605\u2192GO LIVE CHAT WITH REAL PEOPLE\r\nGo live and chat with real people on SOYO, the ultimate social app for live chat and online chat. Our registration process ensures real-person authentication, guaranteeing authentic interactions. We match you randomly with someone, ensuring you're always excited to meet strangers and have a chat.\r\n\u2605\u2192HIGH RESPONSE RATE TO MAKE FRIENDS\r\nWorried about unresponsive conversations? In SOYO, experience a high response rate. Many users are eager to meet strangers and will proactively say hello. You can also initiate conversations with people nearby.\r\n\u2605\u2192A SOCIAL APP WITH HEALTHY COMMUNITY \r\nJoin our healthy community where users make friends and share life moments. Give a thumbs-up to their wonderful experiences. Some even use their voices to introduce themselves, allowing you to directly listen or browse photos before getting to know each other, make friends.\r\n\r\nWHY SHOULD I CHOOSE SOYO?\r\n\r\nSOYO is focused on details so that it will entertain more people. On SOYO, tap to start voice chatting in 3 seconds!\r\n\r\nDownload SOYO and begin to share your happiness with the world NOW!\r\n\r\nIf you have a suggestion, please let us know, we look forward to your voice!\r\nSOYO Support Email\uff1asupport@newlumos.com\r\n\r\n\u3010Subscrption Policy\u3011\r\nUpon user confirmation and payment, charges will be applied to the Google Play account. Users can manage subscriptions and auto-renewal settings in their account preferences. To cancel auto-renewal, manually disable the feature in Google Play account settings at least 24 hours before the current subscription period ends.\r\n\r\nOur Plan:\r\n1. The SuperStar subscription is available at various pricing tiers, offering users flexible options.\r\n2. Subscribers can opt for a monthly plan at $9.99, a 3-month plan at $26.99, or a 12-month plan at $99.99.\r\n3. Prices may vary in countries. Google Play account will be debited within 24 hours before expiration, extending the subscription cycle after successful deduction.\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.newlumos.com/privacyPolicy\r\nTerms and Conditions: https://www.newlumos.com/termService",
