load SOYO and begin to share your happiness with the world NOW!<br><br>If you have a suggestion, please let us know, we look forward to your voice!<br>SOYO Support Email\uff1asupport@newlumos.com<br><br>\u3010Subscrption Policy\u3011<br>Upon user confirmation and payment, charges will be applied to the Google Play account. Users can manage subscriptions and auto-renewal settings in their account preferences. To cancel auto-renewal, manually disable the feature in Google Play account settings at least 24 hours before the current subscription period ends.<br><br>Our Plan:<br>1. The SuperStar subscription is available at various pricing tiers, offering users flexible options.<br>2. Subscribers can opt for a monthly plan at $9.99, a 3-month plan at $26.99, or a 12-month plan at $99.99.<br>3. Prices may vary in countries. Google Play account will be debited within 24 hours before expiration, extending the subscription cycle after successful deduction.<br><br>Privacy Policy: https://www.newlumos.com/privacyPolicy<br>Terms and Conditions: https://www.newlumos.com/termService",
